Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/mode
Type: select
Choices: beyla-only, sdk
Default: beyla-only
Description: Select the instrumentation mode
 Choose beyla-only to run the Alloy Beyla component without SDK injection, or
 choose sdk to opt in selected controlled systemd services to SDK injection.

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/otlp-endpoint
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud OTLP endpoint
 Enter the full OTLP HTTP endpoint URL.

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/otlp-tenant
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud OTLP tenant or instance ID

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/otlp-token
Type: password
Description: Grafana Cloud OTLP token

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/metrics-endpoint
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud Prometheus remote-write endpoint

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/metrics-tenant
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud metrics tenant or instance ID

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/metrics-token
Type: password
Description: Grafana Cloud metrics token

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/profiles-endpoint
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud profiles endpoint

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/profiles-tenant
Type: string
Description: Grafana Cloud profiles tenant or instance ID

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/profiles-token
Type: password
Description: Grafana Cloud profiles token

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/services
Type: string
Description: Controlled systemd service units to instrument
 Enter a comma-separated list of controlled service unit names (for example,
 demo.service). Only these services receive SDK injection. Do not select
 production services in this PoC.

Template: grafana-beyla-sdk/open-ports
Type: string
Description: Comma-separated ports of application services to instrument
 Enter only the ports of services that should be instrumented by Beyla, for
 example 8080 or 8080,8081. Port ranges are accepted.
